            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SubFuse Beta 0.9</h2>
<p>Currently supports Claude, ChatGPT, and Cursor only.</p>
<ul><li>Check for updates directly from the app menu or Settings.</li><li>Automatic update checks with a setting to turn them off.</li><li>Signed update downloads and feeds hosted on GitHub.</li><li>SubFuse Beta branding; existing local profiles remain compatible.</li></ul>
<p>This beta requires Apple Silicon and macOS 14 or later. It is not Apple-notarized.</p>
]]></description>
